Author:     dualface <dualface@gmail.com>
AuthorDate: 2026-09-09 15:58:10
Commit:     dualface <dualface@gmail.com>
CommitDate: 2026-09-09 15:58:10

    test: assert Options overlay path on the post-resize PTY frame
    
    The narrow-screen check searched the whole PTY history, so a
    filename from the wide frame made resize appear to pass. Wait for
    new output after SIGWINCH and inspect only that frame.

commit bf1b9b239e5943dfd809fd906e396192fc71d57d
Author:     dualface <dualface@gmail.com>
AuthorDate: 2026-09-09 15:58:02
Commit:     dualface <dualface@gmail.com>
CommitDate: 2026-09-09 15:58:02

    fix: refresh Options inherit chrome and ignore tabs while confirming
    
    Launcher, model, and stage edits created overlay keys but left the
    inherit prefix and restore control stale until the page was rebuilt.
    Close confirm hid the tab bar without clearing hit regions, so a
    click could switch scope and still save on Enter.

commit 28a5f5d75138b51dbf734a092c75ef6f41b3b1d7
Author:     dualface <dualface@gmail.com>
AuthorDate: 2026-09-09 15:57:55
Commit:     dualface <dualface@gmail.com>
CommitDate: 2026-09-09 15:57:55

    fix: restore overlay inherit without dropping sibling keys
    
    Restoring a legacy flat review_stages role deleted the shared key
    for both scales, and a failed overlay merge left Target or overlay
    keys half-applied. Expand the edit buffer first, then CAS the
    validated candidate.

commit 64000ab1bdb4044aa3079763e22680a02aae70a2
Author:     dualface <dualface@gmail.com>
AuthorDate: 2026-09-09 15:57:29
Commit:     dualface <dualface@gmail.com>
CommitDate: 2026-09-09 15:57:29

    fix: validate overlay saves against the raw scope document
    
    Project-tab preview and save merged onto a filled Config, so a
    legacy scope that omitted tui accepted a theme-only overlay that
    Load then rejected. Merge overlay keys onto the original JSON.

